Integration 1, AutoStash 397 and Unit 593 passed; zero failures/skips/exclusions. Dedicated integration host exited before fresh focused and Unit hosts. A preceding rebuilt focused run passed 397 cases. Rebuild emitted the same 7 production and 27 test warnings, none newly introduced; final incremental sequence emitted none. The initial new-test run exposed three fixture/assertion mistakes (direct rejection is a failure, automatic zero moves invoke the observer callback, and audit observation requires World.Api); these were corrected without changing production behavior or weakening established assertions. Initial sandbox compiler artifact-write denial was recovered through approved escalation. No game/client/server launch, tooling installation or standalone evidence files occurred. Fresh installed API/Lib/SurvivalMod/Essentials assembly metadata remains 1.22.7.0; API file version 1.22.0, others 1.22.7.

